## API Compatibility Level
1. Edit > Project Settings.
2. Select the Player category from the left sidebar.
3. Expand the Other Settings section in the main panel.
4. Scroll down to the Configuration subsection and locate API Compatibility Level.
5. Change the selection from .NET Standard 2.0 (or .NET Standard 2.1) to .NET Framework (or .NET 4.x depending on your Unity version).
6. Allow Unity to compile the project.
